{
  "experiment": "stain_colour_robustness",
  "model_version": "full_pcam_int8_v1",
  "method": "Held-out fixed-seed subset of the official PCam test split. Perturbations: mild/strong ColorJitter (hue/saturation/brightness/contrast), approximate H&E RGB channel scaling, and fixed warm/cool hue shifts. Not full Macenko or Vahadane stain normalization \u2014 those were out of scope; a simpler colour jitter is used instead.",
